# The roots of a64.sail (sailgen --extract, tools/sailgen/README.md): the decode functions of the subsets sailgen
# generates, and the names it maps or lowers itself, which are neither followed nor copied.
# Every A64 decode clause, copied alone for sailgen --encoders (a64_enc.inc): the encodings of the arm64 host's code
encode __DecodeA64

