stop AddPACIB
stop AddPACDA
stop AddPACDB
stop AuthIA
stop AuthIB
stop AuthDA
stop AuthDB
stop Strip
stop AddPACGA

# NX's loads and stores (nx.sail): guest memory and the exclusive monitor are ScarletNX's, lowered by the back end; the
# access descriptor is EL0's; a pair is one access; little-endian, no alignment fault, no abort syndrome; a
# prefetch does nothing; a CONSTRAINED UNPREDICTABLE encoding runs as written
stop NewAccDesc
stop AArch64_IsUnprivAccessPriv
stop HaveLSE2Ext
stop BigEndian
stop CheckSPAlignment
stop IsAligned__1
stop AArch64_SetLSInstructionSyndrome
stop Prefetch
stop ConstrainUnpredictable
stop Mem_read
stop Mem_set
stop MemAtomic
stop AArch64_SetExclusiveMonitors
stop AArch64_ExclusiveMonitorsPass
stop ExclusiveMonitorsStatus
stop Mem_read__1
stop Mem_set__1
# and what those fixups leave unreached: an exclusive pair's alignment fault, SPE's samples
stop AArch64_Abort
stop AlignmentFault
stop SPESetDataVirtualAddress
stop SPESampleGeneralPurposeLoadStore
stop SPESampleExtendedLoadStore

