# the Arm architecture's floating-point arithmetic, which works on real numbers and the soft-float: the back end lowers
# each (tools/sailgen/README.md, "Lowered"), so only its val is copied
lower FPAdd
lower FPSub
lower FPMul
lower FPDiv
lower FPSqrt
lower FPMulAdd
lower FPMax
lower FPMin
lower FPMaxNum
lower FPMinNum
lower FPCompare
lower FPRoundInt
lower FPRoundIntN
